[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5455388217","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122851#issuecomment-5455388217","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122851","id":5455388217,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRSqeOQ","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-28T17:02:31Z","updated_at":"2026-08-28T17:02:31Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5455388217/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":3,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5788546151","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122851#issuecomment-5788546151","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122851","id":5788546151,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWQY0Zw","user":{"login":"TokisanGames","id":632766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMjc2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/632766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames","html_url":"https://github.com/TokisanGames","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-23T03:38:01Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T03:38:19Z","body":"@Ivorforce One of these recent PRs from you seems to be the cause for Godot 4.8-dev6 to report errors like this for Terrain3D and maybe other GDExtensions:\r\n```\r\nERROR: Object 'Terrain3DMeshAsset' already has member ''.\r\n   at: (core/object/gdtype.cpp:158)\r\nERROR: Object 'Terrain3DMeshAsset' already has member ''.\r\n   at: (core/object/gdtype.cpp:158)\r\nERROR: Object 'Terrain3DRegion' already has member ''.\r\n   at: (core/object/gdtype.cpp:158)\r\nERROR: Object 'Terrain3DTextureAsset' already has member ''.\r\n   at: (core/object/gdtype.cpp:158)\r\nERROR: Object 'Terrain3DTextureAsset' already has member ''.\r\n   at: (core/object/gdtype.cpp:158)\r\n```\r\n\r\nIs there something we need to change to fix it for 4.8 that also works for 4.5-4.7? We get the same results with godot-cpp 4.5 and v10.\r\nIs there an outstanding issue or PR?\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5788546151/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5790663023","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122851#issuecomment-5790663023","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122851","id":5790663023,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWSaBbw","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-23T07:14:43Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T07:14:43Z","body":"@TokisanGames It sounds like your GDExtension is trying to register methods without giving them a name. This results in the methods not being effectively registered at all. That was always the case, but now it complains loudly instead of silently failing.\r\n\r\nThe other possibility is that the name is lost somewhere along the way, but I wouldn't be aware of any way in which this could happen.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5790663023/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5791438377","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122851#issuecomment-5791438377","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122851","id":5791438377,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWTJWKQ","user":{"login":"TokisanGames","id":632766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMjc2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/632766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames","html_url":"https://github.com/TokisanGames","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-23T08:16:46Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T08:16:46Z","body":"Every property and method is registered with a name and every function exposed to the API works in Godot pre 4.8, I haven't tested 4.8.\r\nhttps://github.com/TokisanGames/Terrain3D/blob/main/src/terrain_3d_region.cpp#L489-L502\r\nhttps://github.com/TokisanGames/Terrain3D/blob/main/src/terrain_3d_mesh_asset.cpp#L666-L697\r\nhttps://github.com/TokisanGames/Terrain3D/blob/main/src/terrain_3d_texture_asset.cpp#L259-L273\r\n\r\nInteresting that it's only these classes. Terrain3DMeshAsset, Terrain3DTextureAsset, and Terrain3DRegion are all Resources. However, we have two other classes that are also Resources.\r\n\r\n> The other possibility is that the name is lost somewhere along the way, but I wouldn't be aware of any way in which this could happen.\r\n\r\nIf you can't think of it off the top of your head, we'll need to debug the engine to figure out which PR changed the behavior.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5791438377/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5791727838","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122851#issuecomment-5791727838","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122851","id":5791727838,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWTbA3g","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-23T08:39:43Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T08:39:43Z","body":"This might not have been changed in a PR. What changed is possibly just that it reports now, not necessarily that registration fails in the first place.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5791727838/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5792197121","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122851#issuecomment-5792197121","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122851","id":5792197121,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWT3qAQ","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-23T09:15:35Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T09:15:35Z","body":"@TokisanGames Sorry, that was a wrong assessment. \r\n\r\nThe problem is that your code \"overrides\" a parent member. Previously this was allowed, and your new member shadowed the parent member. Now, this is not allowed anymore because changing the type of a member could violate typing rules.\r\n\r\nIf you're shadowing parent members on purpose, please join the [core channel](https://chat.godotengine.org/channel/core) on rocket chat so we can discuss it.\r\n\r\nThe reason the member name printed as `\"\"` is my fault, fixed in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123752","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5792197121/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5792661376","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122851#issuecomment-5792661376","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122851","id":5792661376,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWUT_gA","user":{"login":"TokisanGames","id":632766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMjc2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/632766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames","html_url":"https://github.com/TokisanGames","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-23T09:50:10Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T09:50:10Z","body":"> The problem is that your code \"overrides\" a parent member.\r\n\r\nIt would be helpful to print what is being shadowed in the error message so we can identify the member variables. \r\n\r\nOf the three classes, I'm only aware of shadowing duplicate() in Terrain3DRegion. The only other thing I can think of for the other two classes is 'name', but they are not exposed properties for Resource or Object.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5792661376/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5792680481","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122851#issuecomment-5792680481","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122851","id":5792680481,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWUVKIQ","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-23T09:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T09:51:28Z","body":"> > The problem is that your code \"overrides\" a parent member.\r\n> \r\n> It would be helpful to print what is being shadowed in the error message so we can identify the member variables.\r\n\r\nYes, that is what https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123752 fixes :)\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5792680481/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]